note = "Based initially on some lettering on an old car hood. Further inspired by a variety of 20th century typefaces. Started as a pure mono-line, the thinking was that it could be another cool variation on a “Hershey” or routable/pen plot-able single line typeface. Now has variable thickness, weights, and lowercase. More clear citation info TK";
